+/**
+ * The deployment's tab strip and the opened pool, drawn INSIDE Overview's own
+ * page (a portal), between its numbers and its regions, so the page keeps
+ * every read, state and refresh of today's Overview and only shows the
+ * regions of the tab picked (homeredraw-place.css).
